// APIKey lets a member call the API. It acts as that member, with the member's current role.
//
// The store keeps only the SHA-256 hash of the token (hex) and its last four characters. Token is set only on the key
// returned when it is created, and on keys loaded from snapshots written before tokens were hashed; it is never stored.
